cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "gr-spin-frustration: relaxation of classical spins with the general-relativistic spin-spin interaction on random point sets"
abstract: >-
  Numerical code for the zero-temperature relaxation of classical spins fixed at
  Poisson-distributed positions and coupled by the general-relativistic spin-spin
  interaction, together with the ensemble analysis of the pair-correlation
  functions C(r) and Q(r).
authors:
