url: "https://github.com/kdemirel/gr-spin-frustration"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
keywords:
  - general relativity
  - spin-spin interaction
  - geometric frustration
  - classical spins
  - pair correlations
